 643:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsIsr.c **** /** Dynamic data and execution structures are very hard to test. For that reasons, while
ARM GAS  C:\Users\SX2605~1.HOD\AppData\Local\Temp\cccNF2gD.s 			page 25


 644:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsIsr.c **** test the full code has been separeated into a piece of code to be executed when an interrupt
 645:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsIsr.c **** occurres, and another piece of code tested statically. When running under real target
 646:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsIsr.c **** conditions (no test harness bound) the successfully tested code gets executed.
 647:common/prog/FuncSafe/fsIsr.c **** */
